{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll step into the shoes of a high school freshman and meet three unique girls\u2014each with a completely different perspective on the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you get to know them, you\u2019ll listen to their stories and search for answers to life\u2019s big questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your journey will lead you to decide what kind of path you truly want to follow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along the way, you\u2019ll uncover the world\u2019s nonlinear structure and the mysteries hidden beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654640/extras/triple_chaos.png?t=1751044953\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique and <i>teasing </i>characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tons of secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Surprise scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A bit of 90s nostalgia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features controls that go beyond a typical visual novel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Existential crisis</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2654640?t=1751044953","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2654640?t=1751044953","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654640/5fdb1b96505502e19e862f0c0d47ce11b55175a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751044953","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654640/5fdb1b96505502e19e862f0c0d47ce11b55175a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751044953","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[